{"id":45510,"date":"2025-10-05T07:54:12","date_gmt":"2025-10-05T06:54:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-boston-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-10-28T09:35:34","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T08:35:34","slug":"maratona-de-boston","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-boston\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Boston 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Boston 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Boston 2027<\/strong> (131\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <em>Boston Marathon presented by Bank of America<\/em>) realiza-se na segunda-feira, <strong>19 de abril de 2027<\/strong> (feriado estadual <em>Patriots' Day<\/em>), com partidas faseadas entre as <strong>09h06<\/strong> (divis\u00f5es em cadeira de rodas e elites \u00e0s 09h37\/09h47) e as <strong>10h00 \u00e0s 11h21<\/strong> (6 vagas gerais) na <strong>Main Street em Hopkinton<\/strong> e meta na lend\u00e1ria <strong>Boylston Street (Copley Square), em Boston, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica<\/strong>. Organizada desde 1897 pela <strong>Boston Athletic Association (B.A.A.)<\/strong>, \u00e9 a maratona anual mais antiga do mundo e uma etapa hist\u00f3rica do circuito <strong>Abbott World Marathon Majors<\/strong> e <em>World Athletics Platinum Label<\/em>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O exigente percurso ponto a ponto de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> atravessa oito cidades e vilas de Massachusetts \u2014 Hopkinton, Ashland, Framingham, Natick, Wellesley (famosa pelo <em>Scream Tunnel<\/em> do Wellesley College a meio da prova), Newton (onde se situam as quatro colinas entre os km 25 e 34, culminando na m\u00edtica subida de <strong>Heartbreak Hill<\/strong>), Brookline e Boston \u2014 terminando ap\u00f3s a c\u00e9lebre viragem <em>Right on Hereford, Left on Boylston<\/em>. Para a edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027, a B.A.A. aceitou 25.630 maratonistas qualificados por tempo (com corte <em>Boston Qualifier<\/em> de 5 minutos e 17 segundos abaixo do tempo padr\u00e3o de cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio, al\u00e9m de um sorteio suplementar de 1.000 qualificados), num pelot\u00e3o total de 30.000 atletas apoiados por mais de 10.000 volunt\u00e1rios regidos pelo C\u00f3digo de Conduta oficial da B.A.A. No s\u00e1bado, 17 de abril de 2027, o programa abre com a <strong>Boston 5K<\/strong> \u00e0s 08h00 no Boston Common e as corridas <em>B.A.A. Invitational Mile<\/em> e <em>Youth Mile<\/em>. Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Main Street, Hopkinton (Partida) e Boylston Street \/ Copley Square (Chegada), Boston, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">42,2 km e 5 km<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Boston Athletic Association (B.A.A.)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">6h00 ap\u00f3s a \u00faltima vaga (Meta encerra \u00e0s 17h30)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.baa.org\/volunteer\/code-of-conduct-rights-responsibilities\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">131st Boston Marathon presented by Bank of America (42,195 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 (Vagas 1 a 6) | 09:06 (Elite \/ Cadeiras)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">385,00 $ a 390,00 $ USD<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Boston 5K presented by Mass General Brigham<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">55,00 $ a 65,00 $ USD<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida da Maratona de Boston 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 131\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Maratona de Boston realiza-se na segunda-feira (Patriots' Day), 19 de abril de 2027, com partida em Hopkinton (Massachusetts). As divis\u00f5es de Cadeira de Rodas partem \u00e0s 09h06 e 09h09, Handcycles \u00e0s 09h30, Elite Masculina \u00e0s 09h37, Elite Feminina \u00e0s 09h47, Para Athletics \u00e0s 09h50 e o pelot\u00e3o geral em 6 vagas (Wave 1 \u00e0s 10h00, Wave 2 \u00e0s 10h15, Wave 3 \u00e0s 10h28, Wave 4 \u00e0s 10h41, Wave 5 \u00e0s 11h01 e Wave 6 \u00e0s 11h21).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual foi o tempo de corte (BQ Cut-off) para a Maratona de Boston 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De entre as 33.649 candidaturas submetidas entre 14 e 18 de setembro de 2026 na plataforma Athletes' Village da B.A.A., o corte direto de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o (Boston Qualifier) fixou-se em 5 minutos e 17 segundos abaixo do tempo padr\u00e3o de cada faixa et\u00e1ria e g\u00e9nero, complementado por um sorteio adicional de 1.000 atletas qualificados, totalizando 25.630 qualificados aceites.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite do percurso e a idade m\u00ednima de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os participantes devem ter pelo menos 18 anos de idade no dia da corrida e disp\u00f5em de um tempo limite oficial de 6 horas l\u00edquidos ap\u00f3s a partida da \u00faltima vaga (Wave 6), encerrando a cronometragem oficial na meta da Boylston Street aproximadamente \u00e0s 17h30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as regras de conduta e seguran\u00e7a da B.A.A. para atletas e volunt\u00e1rios?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Nos termos do C\u00f3digo de Conduta e Regulamento da Boston Athletic Association (B.A.A.), os dorsais s\u00e3o estritamente pessoais, intransmiss\u00edveis e n\u00e3o reembols\u00e1veis, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio apresentar identifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial com fotografia no levantamento do kit na Expo (Hynes Convention Center \/ MassMutual Center) e respeitar as normas de inspe\u00e7\u00e3o de sacos, seguran\u00e7a p\u00fablica e n\u00e3o discrimina\u00e7\u00e3o em todo o percurso.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso correr a Maratona de Boston sem tempo de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o BQ?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Al\u00e9m da qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o por tempo (BQ), \u00e9 poss\u00edvel participar atrav\u00e9s do Bank of America Boston Marathon Official Charity Program (que integra 215 organiza\u00e7\u00f5es sem fins lucrativos oficiais) ou atrav\u00e9s de operadores tur\u00edsticos internacionais credenciados pela B.A.A.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Boston 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-19\", \"endDate\": \"2027-04-19\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Boston, Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica\", \"addressRegion\": \"Estados Unidos da Am\u00e9rica\", \"addressCountry\": \"US\"}}, \"description\": \"A Maratona de Boston 2027 realiza-se a 19 de abril nos EUA. Corre os lend\u00e1rios 42,2 km das World Marathon Majors de Hopkinton a Boylston Street e v\u00ea o guia!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/maratona-de-boston-2027.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.baa.org\/races\/boston-marathon\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida da Maratona de Boston 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 131\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Maratona de Boston realiza-se na segunda-feira (Patriots' Day), 19 de abril de 2027, com partida em Hopkinton (Massachusetts). As divis\u00f5es de Cadeira de Rodas partem \u00e0s 09h06 e 09h09, Handcycles \u00e0s 09h30, Elite Masculina \u00e0s 09h37, Elite Feminina \u00e0s 09h47, Para Athletics \u00e0s 09h50 e o pelot\u00e3o geral em 6 vagas (Wave 1 \u00e0s 10h00, Wave 2 \u00e0s 10h15, Wave 3 \u00e0s 10h28, Wave 4 \u00e0s 10h41, Wave 5 \u00e0s 11h01 e Wave 6 \u00e0s 11h21).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual foi o tempo de corte (BQ Cut-off) para a Maratona de Boston 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"De entre as 33.649 candidaturas submetidas entre 14 e 18 de setembro de 2026 na plataforma Athletes' Village da B.A.A., o corte direto de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o (Boston Qualifier) fixou-se em 5 minutos e 17 segundos abaixo do tempo padr\u00e3o de cada faixa et\u00e1ria e g\u00e9nero, complementado por um sorteio adicional de 1.000 atletas qualificados, totalizando 25.630 qualificados aceites.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite do percurso e a idade m\u00ednima de participa\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os participantes devem ter pelo menos 18 anos de idade no dia da corrida e disp\u00f5em de um tempo limite oficial de 6 horas l\u00edquidos ap\u00f3s a partida da \u00faltima vaga (Wave 6), encerrando a cronometragem oficial na meta da Boylston Street aproximadamente \u00e0s 17h30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as regras de conduta e seguran\u00e7a da B.A.A. para atletas e volunt\u00e1rios?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Nos termos do C\u00f3digo de Conduta e Regulamento da Boston Athletic Association (B.A.A.), os dorsais s\u00e3o estritamente pessoais, intransmiss\u00edveis e n\u00e3o reembols\u00e1veis, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio apresentar identifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial com fotografia no levantamento do kit na Expo (Hynes Convention Center \/ MassMutual Center) e respeitar as normas de inspe\u00e7\u00e3o de sacos, seguran\u00e7a p\u00fablica e n\u00e3o discrimina\u00e7\u00e3o em todo o percurso.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como posso correr a Maratona de Boston sem tempo de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o BQ?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Al\u00e9m da qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o por tempo (BQ), \u00e9 poss\u00edvel participar atrav\u00e9s do Bank of America Boston Marathon Official Charity Program (que integra 215 organiza\u00e7\u00f5es sem fins lucrativos oficiais) ou atrav\u00e9s de operadores tur\u00edsticos internacionais credenciados pela B.A.A.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66366,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,31],"event_type_2":[1069,1070],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[1096],"class_list":["post-45510","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-boston-estados-unidos-da-america","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-america","event_type_2-usa","event_type_5-majors"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/maratona-de-boston-2027.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/45510","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=45510"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/45510\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":71028,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/45510\/revisions\/71028"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/66366"}],"wp:attachment":[{"hre